    <item>
      <title>C# 에서 Dispose, Close, Stop의 차이</title>
      <link>https://ezaurum.com/2015/02/C%23-%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-Dispose-Close-Stop%EC%9D%98-%EC%B0%A8%EC%9D%B4/</link>
